    "detailed_description": "&quot;Fried Chicken Nuggets and Angels&quot; is a text based adventure game with the theme of a detective story.<br>The story takes place in a fictional Japanese town of S City. The killer &quot;Rooster&quot; who killed six innocent girls has committed a new crime.<br>Fortunately, at the scene of the seventh homicide, the police found important clues pointing to the murderer...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2>\u30fbExplore and collect clues on the map, rummaging through boxes and cabinets like a traditional Japanese RPG<br>\u30fbShow the right clues to the right characters to get new clues<br>\u30fbAfter collecting enough clues, it will enter the reasoning mode<br>\u30fbIn reasoning mode, you need to make the right choice and find the key words<br>\u30fbThere are 3 endings in this game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Characters</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481400/extras/333823733520f81d66f7f696cef3010e.avif?t=1735165719\" /></span><br><strong>Ren Saionji</strong><br>An elite detective from the First Investigation Section of the Metropolitan Police Department.<br>Has the special ability to talk to the dead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481400/extras/5109bcb08d4a1426696630a525daa8c7.avif?t=1735165719\" /></span><br><strong>Sakura Amamiya</strong><br>A rookie who has just passed the criminal police assessment,<br>Silently fell in love with Ren.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481400/extras/5fb55ecf9fa938c2b9eb066efc0739d7.avif?t=1735165719\" /></span><br><strong>Sera</strong><br>A mysterious girl who calls herself Seraph.",
